  "description": "The All-New Tazer is a ground-up redesign built around the new Dual Co-Rotating (DCR) Link suspension platform, tailored specifically for powered riding. Paired with Bosch’s latest fifth-generation Performance Line CX motor, delivering up to 120Nm of torque, the system and suspension are engineered to work in complete unison - eliminating the traditional compromises between power and performance.\nThis frameset is equipped with Bosch's 800Wh battery and integrated Kiox 400C display.\nAvailable in MX wheel configurations with 29\" coming soon, and Powermore 250 compatibility. Offered in Satin Blue or UD Black, with the UD Black finish featuring a clear over carbon finish that reveals the raw carbon weave, giving every frame its own unique character and one of a kind appearance.",
